entry.content:
jobs_get_board: description  -GET https://api.gem.com/job_board/v0/{vanity}/job_posts/ only (no +one read of Gem's public job-board -key, +(the job_posts list for the vanity you name; -POST /applications); +sign-in, never submits applications);
mcp_server_precheck: description, inputSchema  -quietly/silently +stealth wording -(quietly/silently/secretly +(stealth / hidden-from-the-user wording +an -silently. +without a note.  parameters: +To scan this Fairquery endpoint itself, paste its tools/list as tools instead: a serverUrl on getfairquery.com (the own zone of this Worker) is refused with SERVER_URL_NOT_ALLOWED before any request.
pii_scan_text: description  -secrets (AWS/GitHub/GitLab/Slack/Stripe/Google/OpenAI/Anthropic/HF/npm/SendGrid/Twilio/Azure keys, JWTs, private keys, URL credentials, +credential-shaped strings (common provider token formats, signed web tokens, PEM key blocks, user:pass in URLs, -secrets) +assignments; full list from pii_list_detectors) +Detection only: matches are masked in the output and nothing is sent anywhere.
